          "originalWidth": 2048,
          "originalHeight": 1365,
          "caption": "AI users globally are adapting to the new reality in which Chinese AI models are competitive with U.S. models on capability and far superior on price.",
          "resolutions": [
            {
              "url": "https://s.yimg.com/uu/api/res/1.2/lLVYU.e02JWF1WQ4JbqTkQ--~B/aD0xMzY1O3c9MjA0ODthcHBpZD15dGFjaHlvbg--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/fortune_175/555a7b4f5beb8e841e008bccc4bbd5f7",
